message: "If you use Fab OpenVLC in research, please cite this software and the related publications listed in the repository."
title: "Fab OpenVLC: Intelligent Management for Hybrid Visible Light Communication and WiFi"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Ngo"
    given-names: "Trung Kien"
