abstract: >-
  Fab OpenVLC provides an Intelligent Management System and reproducible
  testbed resources for centralized monitoring and handover management in
  hybrid Visible Light Communication and WiFi networks built around OpenVLC.
keywords:
  - visible light communication
  - OpenVLC
  - hybrid networks
  - WiFi
  - handover management
  - BeagleBone Black
  - experimental testbed
